# Supabase Cloud Database Configuration for TOHFA
# 1. Sign up free at https://supabase.com
# 2. Create a new project (e.g. "tohfa-gifting")
# 3. Copy Project URL and Anon API Key from Project Settings -> API
# 4. Create a .env file with these values:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key-here
